  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programming and reporting support for the EU Delegation to Georgia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The global objective of this assignment is to support the EU Delegation to Georgia in planning future EU assistance in the field of sustainable and inclusive socio-economic development and in reporting on implementation of financial assistance in Georgia and relevant bilateral cooperation activities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The specific objectives of this assignment are as follows: &lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot; class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;To support the EU Delegation in the identification/formulation phase of its upcoming multi-annual programming exercise; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot; class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;To support the EU Delegation in the preparation of regular and/or ad-hoc reports.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
